Z||000000||Phil||05-23-2000||09:13 AM||||Starting to pack for my cross country safari.  Leaving RI fri. afternoon to be in San Bernardino CA  June 1 for the kickoff day of Power Tour. <BR>June 2 is Phoenix AZ<BR>June 3 is Alburquerque NM<BR>     4--Elk City OK<BR>     5--Tulsa OK<BR>     6--Tunica MS<BR>     7-- Day off<BR>     8--Talladega AL<BR>     9&10 Panama City Beach FL<BR>If anybody is in those areas stop by and say hello (I'll even let you do my laundry,as you all know packing space in a Fiero is not one of its strong points). I don't know if they are going to do daily updates on the web site  but it's <A HREF="http://www.emapusaevents.com" TARGET=_blank>www.emapusaevents.com</A>    If the wife and I aren't too tuckered might even try to catch the Williamsburg VA show on the way home. I figure I could win the longest distance driven to the show(approx 7000mi.)<BR>Wish me luck<p>[This message has been edited by Phil (edited 05-23-2000).]||||reg||1
